    <panel_attributes>title=SD12 Restore caches and read dashboard snapshots
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=CourseService~c
obj=ProgressRestorer~r
obj=QuizRepository / StudyPlanRepository~q
obj=ProgressTracker~t
obj=HistoryRecorder~h
obj=DashboardView~d

u-&gt;f : getProgress(courseId) or getHistory(courseId)
f-&gt;c : getCourse(courseId)
c.&gt;f : saved Course
f-&gt;r : restore(course)
r-&gt;h : saveIfMissing()
r-&gt;t : retryPendingSave()
r:Pending in-memory cache writes retry even if source recovery will stop
r-&gt;q : listAttempts(courseId), listPlans(courseId)
q.&gt;r : readable records, with skipped-file warnings
r:Rebuild counts from readable sources
r-&gt;t : getSummary(courseId)
t.&gt;r : previous counts and IDs
r:If source reads fail or counted IDs are missing, keep prior counts and return with a warning
combinedFragment=opt~rebuild r h; h:[Sources retain every previously counted record]
r-&gt;t : restoreSummary(rebuilt)
t:Notify only when counts change, not for a pending-write retry
t.&gt;r : whether counts changed
r:Report rebuilt progress only when counts changed
r-&gt;t : recordEvent for a missing saved or labelled recovered event
t-&gt;h : update(subject)
h:Deduplicate IDs and attempt history save
--
r.&gt;f : recovery complete or warning
f-&gt;t : getSummary(courseId) for progress
t.&gt;f : progress copy
f-&gt;h : getHistory(courseId) for history
h.&gt;f : chronological event copies
f.&gt;u : requested state, with storage warnings available
d-&gt;f : getProgressSnapshot / getHistorySnapshot
f.&gt;d : memory copies without restore or file writes
r:Use saved completedAt, with labelled recovery times only for legacy tasks</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
